            "review_title": "Review at Hotel Grand Saigon",
            "review_text": "dutchy23\nAmersfoort, The Netherlands15 contributions\n0\nWorst food in 15 years I've been in Vietnam\nJul 2026 • Family\nReservation made in the grand lounge rooftop restaurant. Place is ok restaurant messily decorated. Ordered chicken te derloin and waygu beef . After 20 minutes only the chicken steak and waygu beef arrived 20 minutes later. Everything was dry and well done. Then the account converted 200 euros . For Vietnam you eat the in eg park hyatt opera restaurant which is really great. Do not eat here so much better choices in HCM\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Dutch\nShow original\nWritten July 14, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
