            "review_title": "Review at Hotel Grand Saigon",
            "review_text": "69Caz\nPerth, Australia443 contributions\n0\nGood location, expensive, poor quality food.\nMar 2024 • Family\nLocated on the roof of the Hotel Grand Saigon, as a hotel guest, we headed straight to The Rooftop Grand Lounge for our first meal in Ho Chi Minh City. The surroundings are lovely. The quality of the food didn’t live up to expectations and it was expensive. Cooked vegetables accompaniments were almost raw and were served cold. Even mashed potato was served cold. Dishes were served with different accompaniments to what was stated on the menu.\nRead more\nWritten April 1, 2024",
